# Fit LLM Guide

Use this module when working inside `src/enclosure/features/pattern/fit`.

## Rules

- Keep domain models in `domain`.
- Keep workspace access and filesystem adapters in `infrastructure`.
- Keep use-case orchestration in `application`.
- Keep CLI and presentation in `ui`.
- Use `settings.metadata.recipes_dir` for the recipe root and feature-owned recipe path helpers for manifest filenames.
